# Frontend
- Reuse existing components and CSS conventions; do not create an unrelated design system.
- Keep business calculations in backend/domain when appropriate; avoid divergent frontend formulas.
- Read only the affected page/component, its immediate dependencies, and API contract.
- Validate TypeScript and frontend build after relevant changes; clearly state when UI verification was not performed.
